{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was inspired and influenced by the original Rogue - a 'roguelike' genre defining game from the '80s originally played in Unix text terminals -\u00a0but adds many enhancements and refinements in order to allow for more modern user friendly experience - all while preserving the original feel and gameplay -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many differences to the original to list, among the most important are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- adjustable difficulty settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- levels in the run are persistent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- more descriptive events and more of them are logged to game log, including all AD rolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- rebalanced monsters, items and effects stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- more varied dungeon layouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- several new and changed items including\u00a0new special dungeon objects to interact with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- game seed to deterministically generate game content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- new sounds effects for monsters and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- high contrast display option</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- stomach of the hero is also always full - there is no hunger mechanic for now</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiles by Oryx</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a veteran roguelike player or someone new to the genre, this game delivers fresh yet familiar experience hopefully enjoyable for both, while adding on top of old genre defining classic.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125780?t=1770561775","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4125780?t=1770561775","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125780/261f0bda60cbde8b5ffad739fa687087389aa675/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1770561775","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125780/261f0bda60cbde8b5ffad739fa687087389aa675/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1770561775","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game was inspired and influenced by the original Rogue - a 'roguelike' genre defining game from the '80s originally played in Unix text terminals -\u00a0but adds many enhancements and refinements in order to allow for more modern user friendly experience - all while preserving the original feel and gameplay -</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many differences to the original to list, among the most important are</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- adjustable difficulty settings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- levels in the run are persistent</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- more descriptive events and more of them are logged to game log, including all AD rolls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- rebalanced monsters, items and effects stats</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- more varied dungeon layouts</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- several new and changed items including\u00a0new special dungeon objects to interact with</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- game seed to deterministically generate game content</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- new sounds effects for monsters and effects</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- high contrast display option</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- stomach of the hero is also always full - there is no hunger mechanic for now</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tiles by Oryx</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you're a veteran roguelike player or someone new to the genre, this game delivers fresh yet familiar experience hopefully enjoyable for both, while adding on top of old genre defining classic.</p>","developers":["r618"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4125780/a4f16e634439769abd673f3e1ecb4f67579f54ab/header.jpg?t=1770561775","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125780/376130773/6002920b1a92804618bd17780aaf86f863667725/1763642266/dash_av1.mpd?t=1763642585","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125780/376130773/6002920b1a92804618bd17780aaf86f863667725/1763642266/dash_h264.mpd?t=1763642585","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4125780/376130773/6002920b1a92804618bd17780aaf86f863667725/1763642266/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1763642585","id":257235187,"name":"Hollows Of Rogue gameplay trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257235187/d3169cb9abd79061942406bfb421c0444b98b979/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1763642585"}],"name":"Hollows Of Rogue","package_groups":[{"description":"","display_type":0,"is_recurring_subscription":"false","name":"default","save_text":"","selection_text":"Select a purchase option","subs":[{"can_get_free_license":"0","is_free_license":false,"option_description":"","option_text